{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "01974c09-d79e-8580-a95f-4e4d07e2d762",
  "created_at": "2026-03-12T11:34:52-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anh Mensah",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:28:53-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:28:56-04:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning, Greg. Yes, um, my name is Anh Mensah. I live on Mill Street. You know, I grew up down by the harbor, and back then nobody had fences. You just walked through everybody's yard to get to the water. Anyway, that's not why I'm calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:29:15-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:29:19-04:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So my neighbor is putting up a fence. They had the guys out Monday with the posts and everything. And I thought, well, if he's doing it, I'd like to do the same on my side. But I don't know what the rules are."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:29:37-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. What kind of fence are you thinking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:29:41-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Vinyl. White vinyl, five feet tall. Is that, is five feet okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:29:47-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally a fence like that is going to need a permit, yes. Height matters, and so does where you are. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:29:57-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "310 Mill Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:29:59-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's up in the Historic Hill area."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:30:03-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. So wait, do I need a permit, or do I just call the city and tell you I'm doing it? Because my neighbor, I don't think he got anything. He just started."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:30:17-04:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't tell you what your neighbor did. For you, plan on a permit application, not just a phone call. A phone call doesn't put anything on record for us. You'd fill out an application, usually with a sketch of where the fence goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:30:35-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A sketch. Like a drawing? I'm not an artist, Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:30:40-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Doesn't have to be fancy. Your lot, your house, and a line showing where the fence runs. Some people mark up a copy of their survey if they have one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:30:53-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Survey. Okay. I think I have something from when we bought the house. Is that the same as the, the plot plan? Somebody told me plot plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:31:04-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Close. A plot plan or a survey, either one shows your lot lines. If you've got either, bring that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:31:12-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And then, how close to the property line can I put it? Because I was going to put it right on the line, so there's no gap. Is that allowed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:31:25-04:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a good question to ask before you dig. There are rules on setbacks, and being right on the line can get tricky if the line isn't where people think it is. In your area, being in a historic district can add a review too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:31:43-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A review? So I need two things? The permit and a review?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:31:49-04:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Possibly. It could be one process that includes both. I'd want you to talk to the zoning officer here about the exact setback and whether the historic part applies to your street. I can have someone call you back, or you can come in with your plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:32:08-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Okay. So the five feet, that might not be okay either?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:32:14-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It might be fine, it might not. Front yard and side or back yard are often treated differently. Where on your lot is this going?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:32:25-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The side. Between my house and his. It goes back toward the back yard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:32:31-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, it goes from about the front corner of the house to the back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:32:37-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Then the part by the front of the house is the part they'll look at hardest. Tell the zoning officer exactly that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:32:47-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. I'm writing this down. Permit, drawing, plot plan, setback, review. Did I get that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:32:54-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Application, a drawing of the lot, and the zoning officer will tell you the setback and whether the historic review applies."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:33:04-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the vinyl. Is vinyl allowed? I read somewhere that in the old part of town it's, I don't know, frowned on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:33:13-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That could be part of the review, honestly. Material is something they sometimes weigh in on. I'd ask that same person."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:33:22-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. I'm a little confused, because I thought this would be a quick thing. Like a one-minute call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:33:30-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Most fences are simple once you have the answers. You just want those answers before you buy anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:33:38-04:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's true. I was about to order it. Good thing I called. You know, I just found this new tea, by the way, and I love it. It's a, like a roasted barley and ginger one. I drank three cups yesterday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:33:55-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Glad you found something. So, want me to put in a callback request?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:34:01-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. My number is 401-555-0197."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:34:04-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0197. And it's Anh Mensah, M-E-N-S-A-H?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:34:07-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. Mensah. Anh is A-N-H."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:34:11-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll note it's for a five-foot vinyl side fence at 310 Mill Street, asking about permit, setback, and historic review. Someone should call you in a day or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:34:24-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A day or two. Okay. And if I don't hear, I call back and ask for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:34:31-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Call the main line and ask for Zoning and Inspections. Anyone here can pull up the note."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:34:38-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Greg. I'm still a little unsure about the whole line thing, but I'll ask them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:34:46-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the right plan. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:34:49-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
